* ''One route for place and face'' (operator, 2026-11-06, approving the house's defaults). At the browser founding one typed route binds both the place tree and the founder face's tree; the two trees stay independently keyed and wrapped (one human prompt, two keys), and the node asks for each tree each time. Carrier: `pono/browser-vessel-lift` and custody, carried by the b1 lanes' carriers at their land.

